  {
    time: 'Morning',
    title: 'Out of the city and down the escarpment',
    body: 'Trips towards Naivasha, Hell&rsquo;s Gate, Nakuru and Mount Longonot descend the Rift Valley escarpment on the Nairobi to Nakuru road, with a stop at a viewpoint over the valley floor. Trips towards Amboseli run southeast on the Mombasa road instead.',
  },
  {
    time: 'Late morning',
    title: 'Your main activity begins',
