  {
    time: 'Afternoon',
    title: 'A second stop where the timing allows',
    body: 'Naivasha days often add the Elsamere conservation centre or a viewpoint over Hell&rsquo;s Gate. Nakuru days use the remaining light for a second circuit of the park before the drive home.',
