    t: 'Park and activity fees',
    b: 'Fees are the second half of the price. Hell&rsquo;s Gate entry with the Naivasha boat ride and Crescent Island walk comes to USD 75 per person, while Lake Nakuru and Amboseli each charge USD 90 per person for the day.',
  },
  {
    t: 'Residency status',
    b: 'These prices use non-resident park rates. Kenyan citizens and East African residents pay markedly less, so tell us if that applies and we requote before you pay anything.',
